Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.87,0:00:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌的那段剧情真精彩啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个硬邦邦的家伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.42,0:00:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子爆开 然后血肉模糊的那段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.09,0:00:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是动漫版里的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.26,0:00:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是动画第4集吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 好像是的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么听了那段介绍就知道了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学果然…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是呢 是我妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.44,0:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹喜欢看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是第4集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:36.78,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能有人一起聊闪萌也太幸福了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,动画现在播到第几集了来着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,14集了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:47.71,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝光碟第二卷也快出了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便 在第一卷里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.01,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还附赠了特典 梦幻的第0集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是很清楚嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 我好想看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.39,0:01:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把蓝光碟借给你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.85,0:01:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.31,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天放学以后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就去阿宅同学家看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.64,0:01:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好 当然没问题…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.65,0:01:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知 再怎么说也不行吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.07,0:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟天音很讨厌男生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.44,0:01:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我家里很乱 不能来我家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,而且天音同学很反感\n那就更不该来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.83,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是有什么见不得人的东西吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.25,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就比如我自己画的闪萌同人图
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.67,0:01:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.80,0:01:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次听说你在画闪萌呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,教教我怎么画吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我想…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹让我画闪萌 所以我在练习
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 那放学以后就去阿宅同学家吧\n-会画万普吗 她最喜欢万普 要画好点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.10,0:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,GO
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.52,0:01:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到收拾得还挺干净的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.15,0:01:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以画在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.49,0:02:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,毕业相册呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.91,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.33,0:02:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的两个辣妹居然来我的房间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个阿宅到底该怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办 会怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹！？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第2节 我的房间成了辣妹聚集地！？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是第一次带人回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.97,0:03:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可偏偏…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好多周边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯大人的限定景品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我夹了好多次都没夹到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,毕业相册在哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要随便乱翻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝光碟的话\n传教用的想借多少都可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.91,0:04:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,回家以后慢慢看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起看嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.30,0:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个触感…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊地知 你这是性骚扰\n-哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,建议你不要跟我一起看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.51,0:04:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会很吵的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,会像看演唱会一样挥着荧光棒大喊吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.81,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 还不至于到那种程度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,原来不会啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.73,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你会吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.78,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才说的还不至于到那个程度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为太羞耻了 做不出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别人这么做我完全不介意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时是怎么看的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我会做应援扇 把灯关掉之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,硬核宅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想试试
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.51,0:05:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.80,0:05:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗 我真的会大喊大叫的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那就能看到天音新的一面了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看到喜欢的片段激动得不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,解说表现手法和作画你也不介意吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学平时不就这样嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很夸张哦 比如像这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,整个人阿宅魂都爆发了的感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好有意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.63,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（闪亮萌宠）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好 开始看咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,来劲了来劲了 耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这段不错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看得我好激动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.35,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小米 你来了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.52,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小米之前跟她吵架了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,居然会愿意过来 太感人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.90,0:06:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小米是小幸的第一个人类朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.90,0:06:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那还用说 上吧 小幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小米
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.20,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,完全同步了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为能赢过我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,毒蛇女王 少废话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘少女和毒蛇女王
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,准备上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,太帅了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还是个超级美少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,完全戳中我的萌点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,连名字都没公布
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,人气却高居榜首
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这段是负责作画的外街老师精益求精
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,打磨到极致的重头戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一边看一边解说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太开心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.86,0:06:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样阿宅魂爆发地吵闹还被包容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,活着真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.50,0:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了 接下来这段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,布丁会在这里一闪而过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学碰到我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 房间又暗 靠得又近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一股香味 心脏好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.84,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-完全听不进去\n-阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你在认真看吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起 靠太近了\n-对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你在拍什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正又不会给别人看 有什么关系啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,稀有款天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-拍到啦\n-快删掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.66,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那我把刚才拍的照片\n发到Mins上咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.87,0:07:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的 开玩笑啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.25,0:07:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是想看阿宅同学画的画吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.01,0:07:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他发到Mins上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.01,0:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的Mins账号告诉我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.77,0:08:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可是真的没什么大不了的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 这很珍贵的好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.65,0:08:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌的二创作品可不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那倒确实
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,换做是我肯定也想看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不要嫌弃哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明明说了不会嫌弃的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的账号名该不会是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅海洋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 阿宅同学很有名吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没那回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.55,0:08:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,关注者连50个都不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.01,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你会知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.01,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我就是其中之一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 好帅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 用的是\n只看不说话的私密账号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.56,0:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我搜闪萌同人图的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.40,0:08:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你画得很好就关注了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.07,0:08:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.19,0:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点难为情 但我好开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是不是还知道闪亮大叔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.66,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,知道 那个人画的闪萌图太神了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.37,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个其实私下在交往对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说话呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.00,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.34,0:09:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样一来二去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始教她画画了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.43,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有数位板 好羡慕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,果然感觉很好画呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,离得好近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要不先试着画一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.81,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗 谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好 这下我也算是厨子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学果然是个阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 伊地知同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,撇下你一个人 很无聊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.70,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉有点色色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.79,0:09:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在想什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.25,0:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不太会照顾别人的情绪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-没关系 我早就习惯了\n-诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.84,0:10:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟天音在一起 大家就会撇下我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只顾着跟天音聊天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也经常遇到这种情况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有的人是冲着伊地知来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们太受欢迎了 真头疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.40,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不过太露骨的话就有点不舒服呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那种根本不在意其他女生的态度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让人很不舒服对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们果然不是一个世界的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 哪一个是你喜欢的类型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢小幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.43,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是阿宅同学呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那再见啦 阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你教我画画 下次再教我哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.61,0:11:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次这么开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.66,0:11:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而且也是第一次有朋…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.16,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来我家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有很多地方照顾不周
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也没能好好招待两位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢 阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.05,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对朋友也太客气啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩得很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还看到了天音放飞自我的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.43,0:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 伊地知 真的很羞耻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 今天真的很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.23,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我才要谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.78,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再见啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,学校见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.25,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-玩得好开心\n-嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.50,0:11:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一起玩而已 还那么郑重地道谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.80,0:11:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也太认真了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,上次这么兴奋 是多久以前的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿宅同学啊\n-阿宅同学呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.23,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然发生了好多事\n但今天真的好开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.98,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉房间比平时宽敞多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友回去后就是这种感觉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然伊地知同学说我们是朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.95,0:12:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可我连她们的联系方式都还不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.91,0:12:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这个香味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.46,0:12:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就像被她们俩包围着一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不能有这种变态一样的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.76,0:12:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,画画转移注意力吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.85,0:12:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,幻想中的天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟她刚才还在旁边画画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还是睡觉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.07,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这张床睡着真舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,连幻想中的伊地知同学都出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再教我画画嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.53,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一起看闪萌吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我的房间里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.42,0:13:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我自己的房间 可我却无处可逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.59,0:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,到底该怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那之后发生什么事了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.61,0:13:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.03,0:13:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,心怦怦跳个不停 一整晚都没睡着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,辣妹太可怕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 伊地知呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她好像有点事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛 我还想去个地方的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学就是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.05,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点已经毋庸置疑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放学路上人也少
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学也不在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.68,0:14:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要从天音同学口中套出实话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正是绝佳机会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你用来关注我的小号叫什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 我才不要呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.52,0:14:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为除了闪萌以外
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.11,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还给好多别的内容点了赞\n太羞耻了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.65,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你承认了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.78,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你本人的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.45,0:14:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学会点赞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.88,0:14:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,说明那就不是你妹妹的账号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你会关注我这个闪萌宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小号的存在本身
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你是个阿宅的铁证
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有一套啊 阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你的追问方式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还是太嫩了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.81,0:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小号确实是我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我妹妹才上小学三年级
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说那个账号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.83,0:15:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹还没有手机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那个账号是用来给她看的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.67,0:15:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 天音同学绝对不是阿宅对吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.17,0:15:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 真可惜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本来还想着能交到同好的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.43,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可以试试一起实时追闪萌呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,帝…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是帝国少女啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这就说了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（周日早上）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌要开始啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.86,0:15:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,今天追番比平时要紧张
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.66,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.20,0:15:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和天音同学用私信一起实时追番
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.87,0:16:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是天音同学吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.33,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,确定是天音同学没错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她就没打算掩饰自己是个阿宅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但对方可是辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.97,0:16:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个阿宅在其他方面一无是处
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里绝对不能输
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.72,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你好好见识一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我对闪萌的爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.54,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这场战斗在动画播完后持续了一整天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（睡觉吧 就这么办\n今天谢谢啦 我很开心）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（我才要谢谢你 我也很开心 晚安\n晚安）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.23,0:17:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊 天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.98,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你今天皮肤好透亮哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还是和平时一样冷酷的天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她昨天那个样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.36,0:17:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会只是为了配合我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我又犯了阿宅的老毛病
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等下跟她道歉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天太爽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有勉强天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在学校聊这种话题不太好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你在说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说昨天太爽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.31,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是…\n-没事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不用解释的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.15,0:17:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在说天气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.23,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 不用解释的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是离得有点远
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.45,0:17:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌的枕套
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,animate的门店全部缺货
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,刚发售就抢不到的稀有周边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到超市的童装区居然会有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真亏我能发现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 赶紧买了回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小骏 小响
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在店里乱跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这位妈妈真是不容易啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.43,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我弟弟…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.85,0:18:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小声点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮妈妈买东西 我们家人多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可麻烦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.78,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,和平时比反差也太大了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.41,0:18:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不要一直看啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没化妆 别看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.58,0:18:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会在这种地方遇到呢 真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学慌慌张张的 还真少见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.34,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:59.51,0:19:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的事能帮我保密吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.81,0:19:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你很上道嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.90,0:19:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么她会在意自己没化妆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:12.27,0:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,却不在意近距离接触呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.40,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 这个我也要买
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.48,0:19:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁啊 是琴子的男朋友吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 别瞎说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起啊 阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.46,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛 原来是个阿宅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.34,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去个地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.59,0:19:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.18,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 我买到闪萌的枕套了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.72,0:19:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在哪里找到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.35,0:19:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到一股让我不要多嘴的视线
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是超市的童装区
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.23,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我等下把位置私信发你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.61,0:20:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 你们俩在Mins上互关了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.20,0:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟她一起实时追闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是之前说的小号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我给妹妹建的那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那也跟我互关嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.63,0:20:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.00,0:20:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.13,0:20:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为那是追宅专用号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.63,0:20:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一直不好意思关注
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.22,0:20:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得关注主号很冒昧 就没关注
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 你给天音发私信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她也不怎么回你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.23,0:20:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就算没有一起实时追番
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我发消息她也很快就回
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你什么意思嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,明明我发消息你老是已读不回
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-因为一回消息 你当场就打电话过来\n-吃我一拳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定会说个没完的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.70,0:20:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也给阿宅同学发私信好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你不介意 随时欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.58,0:20:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,能有人一起聊闪萌我很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我也没什么别的朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,基本随时都有空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.09,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在Mins上互关以后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.35,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,突然就有了朋友的感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,人生还真是难以预料啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.23,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,收到消息了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,会是谁呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.73,0:21:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这周末一起出去玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去看电影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这周末有空吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,陪我去animate吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.25,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她们俩居然同时约我出去
